   "title": "Sarva Foam Industries Files DRHP For IPO, Plans 54 Lakh Fresh Shares And New Manufacturing Facility",
   "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5"
  }
 ],
 "synopsis": "Bhopal-based Sarva Foam Industries Limited has filed its Draft Red Herring Prospectus with SEBI for an initial public offering. The IPO includes a fresh issue of up to 54 lakh equity shares and an offer-for-sale of up to 13.50 lakh shares by promoter Kunal Giani. The company plans to deploy Rs 90 crore from the fresh issue to establish a new manufacturing facility for rebonded polyurethane foam products and Rs 30 crore to repay or prepay certain borrowings, with the remaining proceeds allocated for general corporate purposes. Beeline Capital Advisors serves as the book-running lead manager for the proposed listing on the NSE and BSE.",
